CORE dfcc-only
main.c
--dfcc main --enforce-contract callee
^\[my_log\.assigns\.\d+\] line 6 Check that g is assignable: FAILURE$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
--
--
The assignment to g in the variadic callee is still checked against the write
set of callee, whose assigns clause is empty.
